    LLM: '1. Both players flip top card. 2. Higher wins; winner takes both to bottom. 3. Tie = War: lay cards face-down by rank (7â†’7 cards, Kâ†’10, Aâ†’11); flip last; higher wins all. 4. Repeat War if last cards tie. 5. Win all 52 cards.',
