    objective: 'Win all 52 cards by winning battles and wars. Higher card wins each battle (Ace high). On tie, escalation war: number of face-down cards depends on the rank that caused the tie (e.g. 7 to 7 cards, King to 10, Ace to 11); then one face-up card decides; repeat until one player wins the pile.',
    gameplay: '1. Both players flip top card. 2. Higher wins; winner takes both to bottom. 3. Tie = War: lay cards face-down by rank (7â†’7 cards, Kâ†’10, Aâ†’11); flip last; higher wins all. 4. Repeat War if last cards tie. 5. Win all 52 cards.',
